  "description": "Ride in style on the 20\" Durango pavement-style bike. Featuring bold colors and cool specs, the 20\" Durango has what you need for a great ride. The simplicity of a single speed pavement-style bike will help your little rider graduate from a sidewalk bike to larger bikes. The durable steel frame features rear V handbrakes for solid control. This style bike includes an alloy quick release and padded saddle to adjust the seat height for the right fit. A fun ride that will help your child love to ride bikes!\n\nFeatures:\n\nYouth bike designed to help kids graduate from a sidewalk bike. Ideal for riders 5-9 years old\n\nStrong steel frame and fork built for durability, ready for everyday rides and outdoor adventures\n\nSingle-speed design and smooth-rolling tires make pedaling easy and enjoyable for young riders\n\nLow step-through design makes it easy and comfortable for young riders\n\nEquipped with a rear V-brake for reliable stopping power, promoting both safety and proper riding technique\n\nComfortable seat and easy-to-reach handlebars\n\nEasy assembly, no tools needed! Adjustable seat post and quick-deploy pedals all attach in minutes\n\n20-inch tires provide great traction and control for confident riding on sidewalks and paved paths\n\nReflectors on the front and back for added safety\n\nKickstand included\n\nBike weighs approximately 21 lbs.",
